\[
 \operatorname{Tr}\!\left[M\,i(Hd(k)+d(k+q)^TH)_{TT}\right]=0,
 \qquad
 \operatorname{Tr}(MV_{TT})=m\operatorname{Tr}(MH_{TT}).       \tag{26}
\]

At `m=0` the TT vertex-image rank remains `(2,2,2)`, while the union-context,
